  ENDIF.

  IF sy-subrc = 0.

    COMMIT WORK.
*     AND WAIT.

    MESSAGE s017(ZNN_TASK_995).

    CLEAR:
      zother_task_995,
      gv_type,
      gv_mode.

    LEAVE TO SCREEN 0100.

